        "code": {
          "text": "Low back pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Pain across the lower lumbar region centrally and bilaterally, described as a deep ache like 'kidneys screaming'; onset recorded as 4/7. Worse after long shifts standing at checkout and with bending; slightly better lying flat. No specific trauma or heavy lifting beyond usual work duties."
      }
    },
    {
