          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Known short bowel syndrome; baseline loose stools approximately 2–3/day. Over the past week, loose stools increased to 4–5/day, with no blood or severe cramping. Patient reports decreased fluid intake over the past week, especially in hot weather and during longer shifts."
